# ============================================================
# DEPENDENCY RESOLUTION ENGINE — SUPPORT DOCUMENT
# ============================================================
# This engine resolves module dependencies and determines a safe
# execution order. It prevents circular dependencies and ensures
# deterministic startup sequences.
#
# RESPONSIBILITIES:
#   - Register dependencies
#   - Resolve execution order
#   - Detect dependency cycles
#
# Used by:
#   - Orchestrator
#   - Pipeline Execution Engine
